        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.12,
            0.886,
            0.186
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, arm yourself with a ruler and a compass. Let us explore if we can draw these figures with these tools and get familiar with a compass."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.188,
            0.884,
            0.232
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Observe the way a compass is made. What can one draw with the compass? Explore!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.233,
            0.885,
            0.301
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Do you know what curves are? They are any shapes that can be drawn on paper with a pencil, and include straight lines, circles and other figures as shown below:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.286,
            0.304,
            0.768,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.286,
                0.304,
                0.768,
                0.538
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_1_image_4.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.552,
            0.884,
            0.598
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mark a point "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { ^ { \\circ } P ^ { \\prime } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " in your notebook. Then, mark as many points as possible, in different directions, that are 4 cm away from P."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.607,
            0.882,
            0.651
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Think: Imagine marking all the points of 4 cm distance from the point P. How would they look?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.658,
            0.882,
            0.702
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Try to draw it and verify if it is correct by taking some points on the curve and checking if their distances from P are indeed 4 cm."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.704,
            0.629,
            0.771
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Explore, if you have not already done so, and see if a compass can be used for this purpose."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.772,
            0.629,
            0.839
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You can start by marking a few points of distance 4 cm from P using the compass. How can this be done?"
            }
          ]
        },
